+{%- endmacro %}
+
+
+{% macro basis_points(amount_column, bps_column) -%}
+  {{ amount_column }} * {{ bps_column }} / 10000.0
+{%- endmacro %}
+```
+
+Reference: `data_products/atlas_elt/shared/macros/money.sql`.
